            <creation xml:id="creation_364N20182">
               <date isodate="1847-11-04" xml:id="date_N20442">1847-11-04</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_364N20180">
               <p xml:id="idm156">In 1853 a so-called liturgical worship service on Christmas Eve was introduced in Vor Frue Kirke (The Church of Our Lady). Hartmann's short four-part movements with organ accompaniment from 1847 were used at these services up to the present time and became extremely popular not only in Vor Frue Kirke but also throughout the country.</p>
            </history>
